WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,110 --> 00:00:10,250
Has Ayu changed her mind?

2
00:00:10,450 --> 00:00:11,850
Always believe in Ayu

3
00:00:11,850 --> 00:00:13,250
She knows it well

4
00:00:13,850 --> 00:00:16,450
She taught me this method of sealing rice noodles.

5
00:00:16,450 --> 00:00:21,980
Any rouge or gouache will work for you, right?

6
00:00:21,980 --> 00:00:22,980
Ayu has grown up

7
00:00:22,980 --> 00:00:24,780
No longer the kid running behind me

8
00:00:25,540 --> 00:00:26,740
Did I hear my mother say

9
00:00:26,740 --> 00:00:29,340
Ayu didn't run behind you when I was a kid, but you did

10
00:00:29,340 --> 00:00:30,740
Once I ate her candy cake secretly

11
00:00:30,740 --> 00:00:32,740
She chased you for three streets with an elbow sweep

12
00:00:33,140 --> 00:00:34,230
I'm just worried

13
00:00:34,430 --> 00:00:36,430
Then what should Shen Yi do if he treats Ayu badly?

14
00:00:37,480 --> 00:00:38,480
Otherwise

15
00:00:38,880 --> 00:00:42,480
I'll go and take her away from my aunt.

16
00:00:42,480 --> 00:00:44,480
What do you think the Pingninghou Mansion is?

17
00:00:44,480 --> 00:00:45,680
Just teasing you

18
00:00:45,680 --> 00:00:47,280
Since Ayu nodded

19
00:00:47,480 --> 00:00:49,080
Just stop worrying about it
